      "category": "Text",
      "text": "By virtue of the authority vested in me as Mayor of the City of\nNew York, it is hereby ordered that the resolutions of the Board of\nEstimate of January 12, 1956 (Cal. #127) and of August 30, 1956\n(Cal. #61) as amended, relating to payroll check-off of employee\norganization dues, be and the same are hereby repealed, and it is\nhereby further ordered that the following Regulations Governing\nProcedures for Orderly Payroll Check-Off of Union Dues be and the\nsame are hereby established effective October 1, 1969.",
