      "text": "II. Each payroll deduction shall be predicated upon a\nwritten authorization by the employee in a form prescribed by the\nCity Comptroller. Such form prescribed by the Comptroller is set\nforth as Appendix A of this Executive Order. The authorization\ncard shall be signed by each individual employee and filed by\nthe headquarters of the employee organization with the payroll\noffice of the department or agency where the member is employed.",
